## 🏗️ Architecture

```
Presentation (obs.zsh, 386 lines)
        ↓
Application (core/, 931 lines)
        ↓
Data (db_manager, scanner, ai/, schema)
```

**AI Router**: gemini-api > anthropic-api > ollama > gemini-cli > claude-cli
**Database**: SQLite (8 tables + note_embeddings cache, 3 views)
**Key Principle**: Business logic in Core only. CLI is thin presentation.

